WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.278
Vinnie and Mandy looked at each other.

2
00:00:03.279 --> 00:00:07.212
"China?" they said together.

3
00:00:07.213 --> 00:00:11.302
Samir looked at them with great interest.

4
00:00:11.303 --> 00:00:15.906
"Tell me the secret of that trick you just did," he said.

5
00:00:15.907 --> 00:00:19.938
"We don’t know," Vinnie admitted.

6
00:00:19.939 --> 00:00:24.249
"Ah, you do not wish to tell me?" Samir asked.

7
00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:29.334
"No, we really don’t know," said Mandy.

8
00:00:29.335 --> 00:00:34.343
Samir laughed loudly.

9
00:00:34.344 --> 00:00:37.679
"Well, see me if you ever need a job.

10
00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:42.756
That trick could make me—I mean you —a lot of

11
00:00:42.757 --> 00:00:47.595
money." Samir walked behind a curtain at the back of the

12
00:00:47.596 --> 00:00:51.601
stage. "Look at that!" said

13
00:00:51.602 --> 00:00:56.139
Mandy. She could see a group of houses outside a nearby

14
00:00:56.140 --> 00:01:00.427
gate. "I count four buildings," said

15
00:01:00.428 --> 00:01:05.354
Vinnie. "Is it a little village?" asked

16
00:01:05.355 --> 00:01:10.822
Mandy. "Village?" said a laughing voice below

17
00:01:10.823 --> 00:01:14.413
them. The children looked down and saw a

18
00:01:14.414 --> 00:01:19.402
girl. "That is Master Yuan’s courtyard house," the girl

19
00:01:19.403 --> 00:01:22.408
said. "Wealthy people live in such

20
00:01:22.409 --> 00:01:25.868
homes." She looked a bit older than

21
00:01:25.869 --> 00:01:30.178
Vinnie. Vinnie and Mandy jumped down from the

22
00:01:30.179 --> 00:01:33.841
stage. "You’re new to Chang’an," she

23
00:01:33.842 --> 00:01:36.667
remarked. "Everyone knows Master

24
00:01:36.668 --> 00:01:39.538
Yuan. You must be with the visiting

25
00:01:39.539 --> 00:01:42.939
performers. The acrobats are my

26
00:01:42.940 --> 00:01:46.412
favorite." "Acrobats?" said

27
00:01:46.413 --> 00:01:50.549
Vinnie. The girl led them through a noisy crowd of

28
00:01:50.550 --> 00:01:54.734
performers. Jugglers were lifting umbrellas with their

29
00:01:54.735 --> 00:01:58.353
feet. "There they are!" cried

30
00:01:58.354 --> 00:02:03.566
Vinnie. Young girls were jumping and flipping in the

31
00:02:03.567 --> 00:02:07.880
air. "What’s your name?" Mandy said to the

32
00:02:07.881 --> 00:02:11.621
girl. "I’m Mei-Li," the girl

33
00:02:11.622 --> 00:02:13.970
replied. "My parents are

34
00:02:13.971 --> 00:02:18.219
bakers. They made two hundred buns for Master Yuan’s celebration."

35
00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:22.401
Mandy introduced herself and pointed to Vinnie.

36
00:02:22.402 --> 00:02:26.414
"And he’s my brother Vinnie," she said.

37
00:02:26.415 --> 00:02:29.338
"What’s the celebration for?"

38
00:02:29.339 --> 00:02:38.489
"Master Yuan’s son Jinying has passed the first level of the imperial exams," explained Mei-Li.

39
00:02:38.490 --> 00:02:42.135
"What are they?" asked Mandy.

40
00:02:42.136 --> 00:02:44.668
"They are very difficult tests.

41
00:02:44.669 --> 00:02:51.695
There are three levels of exams, and each level is harder than the one before," said Mei-Li.

42
00:02:51.696 --> 00:02:56.220
"If all levels are passed, the person becomes a mandarin.

43
00:02:56.221 --> 00:03:00.134
A mandarin is a very respected official."

44
00:03:00.135 --> 00:03:04.011
"That’s a lot of work," said Mandy.

45
00:03:04.012 --> 00:03:05.795
Mei-Li nodded.

46
00:03:05.796 --> 00:03:08.405
"It takes many years of study."

47
00:03:08.406 --> 00:03:12.077
Vinnie rejoined his sister and Mei-Li.

48
00:03:12.078 --> 00:03:16.952
They walked past two monkeys dressed in red costumes.

49
00:03:16.953 --> 00:03:20.881
The children giggled.

50
00:03:20.882 --> 00:03:24.547
"I have to go to the market," said Mei-Li.

51
00:03:24.548 --> 00:03:26.480
"It was nice meeting you."

52
00:03:26.481 --> 00:03:29.943
"Can we come with you?" asked Vinnie.

53
00:03:29.944 --> 00:03:32.267
"Sure," said Mei-Li.

54
00:03:32.268 --> 00:03:35.481
They walked toward a large gate.

55
00:03:35.482 --> 00:03:41.747
Then Mandy noticed a monkey trainer beating one of the two monkeys.

56
00:03:41.748 --> 00:03:46.272
"That’s not right!" Mandy thought to herself.

57
00:03:46.273 --> 00:03:51.679
She marched over to the trainer as Vinnie and Mei-Li walked on.

58
00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:56.345
"You shouldn’t hurt your animals," said Mandy.

59
00:03:56.346 --> 00:04:00.407
"Mind your own business!" yelled the trainer.

60
00:04:00.408 --> 00:04:05.201
He put the monkey in a cage and walked off.

61
00:04:05.202 --> 00:04:11.147
Vinnie and Mei-Li were already out of sight, walking toward the market.

62
00:04:11.148 --> 00:04:16.735
"Poor thing," said Mandy, as she walked over to the cage.

63
00:04:16.736 --> 00:04:20.681
"Don’t worry, I’ll save you."

64
00:04:20.682 --> 00:04:23.617
Mandy opened the cage.

65
00:04:23.618 --> 00:04:28.346
The monkey jumped out and ran across the square.

66
00:04:28.347 --> 00:04:37.133
"Wait! Come back!" Mandy shouted.

